      "title": "Analogy",
      "content": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Think of perfect square factors like finding perfect pairs inside a box of socks. If you find pairs (perfect squares), you can take them out easily, making what’s left simpler and clearer.</p>"
